        "line": 86,
        "column": 0,
        "offset": 1634
      },
      "end": {
        "line": 97,
        "column": 1,
        "offset": 1922
      },
      "text": "/// Registry owns shapes of one kind.\ntemplate \u003ctypename T\u003e\nclass Registry {\n public:\n  /// Add stores a shape and returns its index.\n  std::size_t add(std::unique_ptr\u003cT\u003e shape);\n\n  T* at(std::size_t i) { return items_.at(i).get(); }\n\n private:\n  std::vector\u003cstd::unique_ptr\u003cT\u003e\u003e items_;\n}",
      "hash": "ca20f0ae314eed33ce5eb8596c8b0831bdbf7470d411d89467077c274e6c4b7e"
    },
