        "line": 101,
        "column": 42,
        "offset": 2042
      },
      "text": "/// largest returns the shape with the largest area.\ntemplate \u003ctypename T\u003e\nT* largest(const std::vector\u003cT*\u003e\u0026 shapes);",
      "hash": "a240eda30300bc4dab43264a223b5ef3c8d38fe97e57174bf4fc2a17e510df31"
